# Alternate deterministic two-player seed. It uses the same post-boot credit
# cadence as scripted.cab, reverses Start order, and changes both players'
# movement/action phases. The 240-frame loop expands the schedule past 10,000.
720
loop
2 coin
6
2 2coin
6
2 coin
6
2 2coin
20
2 1p
30
2 2p
60
20 right b1 2right 2b1
5 right b1 b2 2right 2b1 2b2
20 left b2 2left 2b2
5 left b1 b2 2left 2b1 2b2
15 up right b1 2up 2left 2b2
15 down left b2 2down 2right 2b1
20 b1 b2 2b1 2b2
repeat 40
